    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "S. krisalys may attain a snout-to-vent length (SVL) of 7 cm (2.8 in). It has spines above its eyes, and the lining of its mouth is deep blue."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Geographic range",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "S. krisalys is found in the Australian state of Queensland."
    ]
